<h2>Which one do you need?</h2>
<p>MCP is the product connection. After OAuth, the agent can search, save boards, analyze videos, and run deep research on your ContHunt account.</p>
<p>The skill is optional extra instruction. It tells the agent to prefer the hosted MCP, how to handle credits, and not to send you to a private repo.</p>
<p>Most people start with MCP, then add the skill.</p>
